  "mapped_states": "sudoku maps generated only from real callbacks at fixed clock123456; original native Game/Result/Menu structs render exact actual given/entry/notes/clock/stats. Record selected0 because fixture cycles native difficulty before play. Notes4tasks from real imported fixture, fixed8 named slots; calculator original Engine actual7*4 callbacks.",
  "deviations": [
    "Sudoku landscape board uses fitted grid/right pad and help two-column diagrams because original builder fixes board/keypad to800px height.",
    "Notes fixed8slots cannot create/rename/add/phone-edit/sleep/delete native named files; preserve actual import/conversion/help/save/options actions. Native ADD becomes OPTIONS, deckfooter HOW TO IMPORT, confirm right label current actual operation.",
    "Notes physical-selection indicator absent native touch-only builder.",
    "Original ASCII cuts lack some Unicode: imported bytes preserved; display explicit codepoints instead of silently dropping text.",
    "Calculator existing save/clear-entry longpress sheet retained; original native has no such sheet.",
    "Native result one-line ellipsis retained for long captions; full numeric time/hint/counter models preserved.",
    "Original Sudoku pre-hold finger shading has no transient hold-cell in this port; actual long-press pencil write, undo and resulting marks are tested."
  ]
